														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2340318">
									

<p>I'm just not feeling this. There's a ton of mystery and implication, but none of it seems to pay off. It's objectively better than the original (it at least drops most of the body horror), but doesn't work for me.</p>
<p>To me if the current story about the girl and her family feels underdeveloped, which may've been a limitation relating to keeping the spirit of the original alive while still having some new content. Still, I'd much rather hear about the girl's story than learn about the lampreys.</p>

